n-names></name><name><surname>Martinez-Gonzalez</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Badimon</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>HDL-induced prostacyclin release in smooth muscle cells is dependent on cyclooxygenase-2 (Cox-2)</article-title><source>Arterioscler Thromb Vasc Biol</source><year>1997</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>3481</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9437196</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>